### 0 cli render badcells.wtf --format text
$ wtf render badcells.wtf --format text --root <root> --now 2026-09-16T14:00:00-04:00
exit 1
--- stdout
[groceries] := table
| item | quantity | price |
| --- | --- | --- |
| apple | 2 | $3.30 |
| pear | four | $4.30 |

[total] := sum(groceries, quantity * prcie)
--- stderr
<root>/badcells.wtf:5:10: error: Column 'quantity' expects Number, found Text
<root>/badcells.wtf:7:38: error: Unknown column 'prcie' in table 'groceries'
wtf: 2 error(s) while rendering

